# Files are mounted into Linux containers, so keep LF everywhere (also on Windows checkouts).
# Plain "* text=auto" would check out CRLF on Windows (core.autocrlf=true): PHP-CS-Fixer would flag
# every file and shell scripts would fail in the container with "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pbf binary
*.zip binary
